        "Description": "**Admin and user lists must be edited directly in the config files:**\n\n- **Admin Users:** `SCUM/Saved/Config/WindowsServer/AdminUsers.ini`\n- **Server Settings Admins:** `SCUM/Saved/Config/WindowsServer/ServerSettingsAdminUsers.ini`\n- **Whitelist (Exclusive Join):** `SCUM/Saved/Config/WindowsServer/ExclusiveUsers.ini`\n- **Reserved Slots (VIP):** `SCUM/Saved/Config/WindowsServer/WhitelistedUsers.ini`\n\nAdd one [Steam64 ID](https://steamid.io/) per line. For admin permissions, use format: `76561198012345678[SetGodMode,RestartServer]`",
